24 \text{ rands} = 8 \text{ fands}
$$

This gives us the conversion rate:

$$
1 \text{ rand} = \frac{8}{24} = \frac{1}{3} \text{ fands}
$$

---

### Step 3: Convert 5 fands to rands  
Now, we need to find how many rands are equivalent to 5 fands:

