So, if I can find the images of e1 and e2 under the projection, I can construct the matrix. The columns of the matrix are the images of the basis vectors. 

Therefore, the first column of the matrix is the projection of e1, which is (0, 0), and the second column is the projection of e2, which is (0, 1). So the matrix should be:

[ 0 0 ]
[ 0 1 ]

