Now the denominator: 3^3 minus 3^2. Again, I know 3^3 is 27, and 3^2 is 9. So subtracting those gives 27 - 9. That equals 18. So the denominator is 18.

Now the problem becomes 54 divided by 18. Let me compute that. 54 divided by 18 is 3. Because 18 times 3 is 54. So the result is 3. 

